5,1,1,talk,May,,We need to stop guessing who uses this room. I want hard data on who is actually in there.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The noise is the real problem. I can hear every word from my desk. We need to check the walls.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Before we spend money, we must understand the hidden costs. Who is paying for the upkeep right now?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I am worried about the monthly bills. We need to see the invoices for any outside help we hire.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,It feels like we are strangers. I want to know where people actually talk when they need to say something hard.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"@Sakura, if we look at the invoices, we might see if we are overpaying for space we barely use.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, the wall is just plasterboard. I checked. Sound travels easily. We need to verify that.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the tally of use will show if one person is hogging the space. That is a fair start.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Kenji, knowing where awkward talks happen might help us design a space that feels safer for those moments.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, if the wall is thin, maybe a quiet room is the only way to stop the complaints.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the tally of use. It tells the truth about who is here.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the partition wall. I need to know exactly how much sound leaks through.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Servas,,"I will review the facilities callouts. If the equipment breaks often, that is a hidden cost.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will pull the invoices for outside hire. We need to see the real numbers on paper.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at where the last awkward conversation happened. It shows us what we are missing.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Agreed. Let’s see the data before we argue about feelings.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,The wall check is quick. I can do it today.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Servas,,The callouts will reveal if we are paying for maintenance we did not ask for.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Paper doesn’t lie. I will bring the figures to the next round.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I hope this helps us talk better. I will find out what went wrong last time.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
